        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>100+页MAPK信号通路详解</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimSun\", sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #222;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 40px;\n  }\n  h1.main-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  p.intro {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n  }\n  .slide-box {\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    padding: 15px 20px 20px 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .slide-title {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .brand-tag {\n    color: #e07a1f;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .chart-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #777;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .chart-placeholder {\n    height: 150px;\n  }\n  .diagram-placeholder {\n    height: 220px;\n    width: 320px;\n  }\n  .citation {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .citation i {\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 15px 0 0 0;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 2.2;\n  }\n  .bullets li::before {\n    content: \"◆ \";\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .content-flex {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .speaker-icon {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    right: 15px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .bold-cn {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1 class=\"main-title\">100+页MAPK信号通路详解</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">\n    丝裂原活化蛋白激酶(mitogen-activated protein kinase，MAPK)，一种丝氨酸-苏氨酸蛋白激酶。丝裂原，顾名思义，最早发现该激酶参与细胞有丝分裂。所有的真核细胞都能表达MAPK，从酵母到人类都高度保守。\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"slide-box\">\n    <span class=\"slide-title\">细胞凋亡与MAPK</span>\n    <span class=\"brand-tag\">仙航学术</span>\n\n    <div class=\"chart-row\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[Chart: Apoptotic cells (%) bar graph — Control, Anti-NGF, Anti-NGF+FSK, Anti-NGF+bFGF, Anti-NGF+insulin]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[Chart: Relative JNK activity bar graph — Control, Anti-NGF, Anti-NGF+FSK, Anti-NGF+bFGF, Anti-NGF+insulin]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[Chart: Relative p38 kinase activity bar graph — Control, Anti-NGF, Anti-NGF+FSK, Anti-NGF+bFGF, Anti-NGF+insulin]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder chart-placeholder\">[Chart: ERK activity (pmol/min/kinase) bar graph — Control, Anti-NGF]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"content-flex\">\n      <div class=\"citation\">Zhengui Xia et al., <i>Science</i>, 1995</div>\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>一般认为，ERK抑制细胞凋亡</li>\n        <li>p38与JNK促进凋亡</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"speaker-icon\">🔊</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"slide-box\">\n    <span class=\"slide-title\">MAPK信号通路</span>\n    <span class=\"brand-tag\">仙航学术</span>\n\n    <div class=\"content-flex\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder diagram-placeholder\">[Diagram: MAPK signaling pathway cascade — Receptor tyrosine kinases at top, cascade of kinases (Raf/MEK/ERK, MEKK/MKK/JNK, p38 pathways) leading to Nucleus/Transcription factor activation at bottom, with Apoptosis, Proliferation, Differentiation outputs]</div>\n      <ul class=\"bullets\">\n        <li>多级调控，级联放大</li>\n        <li>基于<span class=\"bold-cn\">磷酸化</span>的信号传导形式</li>\n        <li>相对简单、直线、单一的传导方式</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"citation\">Jing Yuan Fang and Bruce C Richardson, <i>Lancet Oncol</i>, 2005</div>\n\n    <div class=\"speaker-icon\">🔊</div>\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
